te":"身長八尺，白皙美姿容，南史作白澈。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","start_codepoint":7,"end_codepoint":18,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:received_sentence1-18","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","source_quote":"累從征討，常爲軍鋒，歷南譙、盱眙、竟陵太守。","reading":"從軍為前鋒，歷南譙、盱眙、竟陵三郡。","note":"從軍為前鋒，歷南譙、盱眙、竟陵三郡。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","start_codepoint":18,"end_codepoint":40,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:received_sentence1-40","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","source_quote":"常語人曰：「我爲郡，所謂四盡：水中魚鱉盡，山中麞鹿盡，田中米穀盡，村里民庶盡。","reading":"弘自言所到四盡，依次為魚鱉、麞鹿、米穀、民庶。","note":"弘自言所到四盡，依次為魚鱉、麞鹿、米穀、民庶。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","start_codepoint":40,"end_codepoint":79,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:received_sentence1-79","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","source_quote":"丈夫生世，如輕塵栖弱草，白駒之過隙。","reading":"以弱草輕塵、白駒過隙喻生世。","note":"以弱草輕塵、白駒過隙喻生世。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","start_codepoint":79,"end_codepoint":97,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:received_sentence1-97","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","source_quote":"人生歡樂富貴幾何時！」","reading":"人生歡樂富貴幾何時，殿本作平生但歡樂富貴幾何時，南史又作人生但歡樂，富貴在何時。","note":"人生歡樂富貴幾何時，殿本作平生但歡樂富貴幾何時，南史又作人生但歡樂，富貴在何時。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","start_codepoint":97,"end_codepoint":108,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:received_sentence1-108","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","source_quote":"於是恣意酣賞，侍妾百餘人，不勝金翠，服玩車馬，皆窮一時之絕。","reading":"侍妾百餘及車馬之富。南史十五另錄府中並稱魚弘、徐君蒨的歌謠。","note":"侍妾百餘及車馬之富。南史十五另錄府中並稱魚弘、徐君蒨的歌謠。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","start_codepoint":108,"end_codepoint":138,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:received_sentence1-138","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","source_quote":"遷爲平西湘東王司馬、新興、永寧二郡太守，卒官。","reading":"本傳平西湘東王司馬，南史鎮西司馬。新興、永寧二郡太守，卒官；兩書未紀卒年月、年齡。","note":"本傳平西湘東王司馬，南史鎮西司馬。新興、永寧二郡太守，卒官；兩書未紀卒年月、年齡。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","start_codepoint":138,"end_codepoint":161,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-liang028-yuhong-death","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","event_type":"death","source_term":"卒","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","start":158,"end":159,"surface":"卒"},"date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","quote":"魚弘，襄陽人。身長八尺，白皙美姿容。累從征討，常爲軍鋒，歷南譙、盱眙、竟陵太守。常語人曰：「我爲郡，所謂四盡：水中魚鱉盡，山中麞鹿盡，田中米穀盡，村里民庶盡。丈夫生世，如輕塵栖弱草，白駒之過隙。人生歡樂富貴幾何時！」於是恣意酣賞，侍妾百餘人，不勝金翠，服玩車馬，皆窮一時之絕。遷爲平西湘東王司馬、新興、永寧二郡太守，卒官。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002:m0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"魚弘","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002:m0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"魚弘","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"魚弘","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete"},{"id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"魚弘","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong"},{"id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"魚","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong"},{"id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete-2-33","title":"南譙太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","attestations":[{"id":"th-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete-2-33:a","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002","start":33,"end":37,"surface":"南譙太守","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002:m0037","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete-ws1511902","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002","quote":"六年，大舉北伐。先遣豫州刺史裴邃帥譙州刺史湛僧智、歷陽太守明紹世、南譙太守魚弘、晉熙太守張澄，並世之驍將，自南道伐壽陽城，未克而邃卒。乃加亶使持節，馳驛代邃，與魏將河間王元琛、臨淮王元彧等相拒，頻戰克捷。尋有密敕，班師合肥，以休士馬，須堰成復進。七年夏，淮堰水盛，壽陽城將沒，高祖復遣北道軍元樹帥彭寶孫、陳慶之等稍進，亶帥湛僧智、魚弘、張澄等通清流澗，將入淮、肥。魏軍夾肥築城，出亶軍後，亶與僧智還襲，破之。進攻黎漿，貞威將軍韋放自北道會焉。兩軍既合，所向皆降下。凡降城五十二，獲男女口七萬五千人，米二十萬石。詔以壽陽依前代置豫州，合肥鎮改爲南豫州，以亶爲使持節、都督豫州緣淮南豫霍義定五州諸軍事、雲麾將軍、豫、南豫二州刺史。壽春久罹兵荒，百姓多流散，亶輕刑薄賦，務農省役，頃之民戶充復。大通二年，進號平北將軍。三年，卒於州鎮。高祖聞之，卽日素服舉哀，贈車騎將軍。諡曰襄。州民夏侯簡等五百人表請爲亶立碑置祠，詔許之。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002:m0037"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-1-29","title":"南譙、盱眙、竟陵太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","attestations":[{"id":"th-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-1-29:a","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","start":29,"end":39,"surface":"南譙、盱眙、竟陵太守","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001:m0000","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","quote":"魚弘，襄陽人。身長八尺，白皙美姿容。累從征討，常爲軍鋒，歷南譙、盱眙、竟陵太守。常語人曰：「我爲郡，所謂四盡：水中魚鱉盡，山中麞鹿盡，田中米穀盡，村里民庶盡。丈夫生世，如輕塵栖弱草，白駒之過隙。人生歡樂富貴幾何時！」於是恣意酣賞，侍妾百餘人，不勝金翠，服玩車馬，皆窮一時之絕。遷爲平西湘東王司馬、新興、永寧二郡太守，卒官。","person_mention_i