ace":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002:m0388","start":388,"end":391,"surface":"夏侯簡","kind":"person","person_id":"lxe_8bu_2sv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete:p002:m0398","start":398,"end":399,"surface":"亶","kind":"person","person_id":"zz1_0tr_xni_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001","text":"魚弘，襄陽人。身長八尺，白皙美姿容。累從征討，常爲軍鋒，歷南譙、盱眙、竟陵太守。常語人曰：「我爲郡，所謂四盡：水中魚鱉盡，山中麞鹿盡，田中米穀盡，村里民庶盡。丈夫生世，如輕塵栖弱草，白駒之過隙。人生歡樂富貴幾何時！」於是恣意酣賞，侍妾百餘人，不勝金翠，服玩車馬，皆窮一時之絕。遷爲平西湘東王司馬、新興、永寧二郡太守，卒官。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":73,"last_line":73,"raw_start":5323,"raw_end":5484,"raw_character_offsets":[5323,5324,5325,5326,5327,5328,5329,5330,5331,5332,5333,5334,5335,5336,5337,5338,5339,5340,5341,5342,5343,5344,5345,5346,5347,5348,5349,5350,5351,5352,5353,5354,5355,5356,5357,5358,5359,5360,5361,5362,5363,5364,5365,5366,5367,5368,5369,5370,5371,5372,5373,5374,5375,5376,5377,5378,5379,5380,5381,5382,5383,5384,5385,5386,5387,5388,5389,5390,5391,5392,5393,5394,5395,5396,5397,5398,5399,5400,5401,5402,5403,5404,5405,5406,5407,5408,5409,5410,5411,5412,5413,5414,5415,5416,5417,5418,5419,5420,5421,5422,5423,5424,5425,5426,5427,5428,5429,5430,5431,5432,5433,5434,5435,5436,5437,5438,5439,5440,5441,5442,5443,5444,5445,5446,5447,5448,5449,5450,5451,5452,5453,5454,5455,5456,5457,5458,5459,5460,5461,5462,5463,5464,5465,5466,5467,5468,5469,5470,5471,5472,5473,5474,5475,5476,5477,5478,5479,5480,5481,5482,5483],"revision_id":1511902},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"魚弘","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete:p001:m0142","start":142,"end":145,"surface":"湘東王","kind":"person","person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-yuhong-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002","text":"時襄陽魚弘亦以豪侈稱，於是府中謠曰：「北路魚，南路徐。」然其服翫次於弘也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":154,"last_line":154,"raw_start":9488,"raw_end":9525,"raw_character_offsets":[9488,9489,9490,9491,9492,9493,9494,9495,9496,9497,9498,9499,9500,9501,9502,9503,9504,9505,9506,9507,9508,9509,9510,9511,9512,9513,9514,9515,9516,9517,9518,9519,9520,9521,9522,9523,9524],"revision_id":1659582},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"魚弘","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"魚","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"徐","kind":"person","person_id":"tvq_5nw_rqn_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"awq_0ji_ba2","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong","book_id":"b-nanshi-015","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong-ws1659582"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-xiahoudan-complete-ws1511902","source":{"title":"梁書卷二十八·夏侯亶","provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511902","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511902","revision_id":1511902,"edition":"維基文庫固定修訂","accessed_on":"2026-11-21","review_status":"text